  "agent": "browser-tester",
  "verdict": "skip",
  "issues": [{"file": "mcp", "severity": "warning",
              "message": "mcp-unreachable: Chrome DevTools MCP not available"}]
}
```
Do NOT proceed past this check if MCP is unreachable.

